{{also|раз}}
==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ru|разо-}} {{i|before certain consonant clusters}}
* {{l|ru|рас-}} {{i|before voiceless consonants}}

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|ru|cu}}, from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*orz-}}. {{doublet|ru|роз-}}, the inherited East Slavic form.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|раз-}}

===Prefix===
{{head|ru|prefix|cat2=verbal prefixes}}

# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} [[asunder]], [[apart]]
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} [[dis-]], [[di-]], [[un-]]
#:* {{m|ru|идти́||to go}} → {{m|ru|разойти́сь||to go asunder, to disagree}}
#:* {{m|ru|дева́ть||to put}} → {{m|ru|раздева́ть||to undress}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} [[enlarged]] action
#:* {{m|ru|рабо́тать||to work}} → {{m|ru|разрабо́тать||to [[develop]], to [[work out]]}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} with [[reflexive]]s, giving [[rein]] to
#:* {{m|ru|говори́ть||to talk}} → {{m|ru|разговори́ться||to talk up a storm}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs|in the negative}} [[not quite]]
#:* {{m|ru|[[Я|я]] [[не]] [[слышать|слы́шал]]||I didn’t hear}} → {{m|ru|[[Я|я]] [[не]] [[расслышать|расслы́шал]]||I didn’t quite hear}}

====Usage notes====
When stressed, {{m|ru|раз-}} normally changes into {{m|ru|ро́з-}}, and the voiceless variant {{m|ru|рас-}} correspondingly becomes {{m|ru|ро́с-}}:
* {{m|ru|разда́ть||to distribute}} → past passive participle {{m|ru|ро́зданный}}
* {{m|ru|расписа́ть||to [[paint]], to [[decorate]]}} + {{m|ru|-ь|pos=noun-forming suffix, which normally causes stress to move onto a prefix}} → {{m|ru|ро́спись||[[painting]], [[mural]]}}

